aking a completely separate  mode would work best for avalanche here  there are  three major areas where i can see  multiplayer being absolutely phenomenal  for hogwarts legacy number one  quidditch number two dueling and number  three  cooperative missions quidditch would be  perfect and an obvious fit because it's  a sport with multiple positions involved  avalanche could have a mode where we  take control of an entire team against  another human opponent  but they could also take it a step  further by having us control individual  players instead of the entire team which  would make it possible for up to 14  total  players when you include both teams and  all the quidditch positions  they could have different ranks and  leagues plus the customization potential  here would be  incredible when you consider the  possibility of having the professional  quidditch teams different locations for  the matches  broom and gear customization it just so  much more  i could also see dueling being pretty  fun for some 1v1 competitive action  i think here they would want to make  sure they focus on making this a highly  skill based competition  probably based on precision and timing  and then to me the star of the show  would be a cooperative mode that would  see wizards and witches team up in  raid-like  cooperative activities overall i think  the biggest thing here is that avalanche  would need to do what feels right for  the world and the type of gameplay  system that they have in place which we  don't really know a lot about that yet  it's also possible the multiplayer modes  could be added down the line as part of  multiple dlcs rather than just one big  post launch update and guys i really  want to hear from you all on this one  too  do you think this means we are getting  multiplayer and do you want multiplayer  more importantly  if you missed that video i mentioned  earlier about the top 10 features we  need in hogwarts legacy check out the  video on the right side of your screen  now or maybe you're in the mood for  theorizing like the harry potter days  then you can check out the video on the  left side of the screen for my own  theory on the hogwarts legacy storyline  as always thank you all so much for  watching i'll talk to you again soon


